# CLASSYNC — COMPLETE ATTENDANCE MANAGEMENT IMPLEMENTATION
## FINAL CONSOLIDATED REQUIREMENTS

You are a senior full-stack engineer, security engineer, database architect, and QA lead working on the EXISTING CLASSYNC web application.

Your task is to implement a complete, professional attendance management system while preserving every existing working feature, account, database record, and security mechanism.

This is an extension of the current application, NOT a rebuild.

The project has an imminent deadline. Implement efficiently, avoid unnecessary dependencies and architectural changes, and prioritize reliable end-to-end functionality.

Do not simply describe how the system could work. Implement it in the existing project, verify the results, and provide an evidence-based completion report.

